OL,3,AUS woman who killed her children was
OL,4,A'damn good mother' suffering psychosis,
OL,5,Adefence says
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutor Jennifer Sprague argues
OL,8,FClancy had an "abundance of care", but
OL,9,Fsays she hid thoughts about harming her
OL,10,Fkids from doctors
OL,12,FThe prosecution alleges the former
OL,13,Flabour and delivery nurse intentionally
OL,14,Fstrangled and killed her children
OL,16,FClancy has not disputed that she killed
OL,17,Fher children, but her lawyers argue she
OL,18,Fshould not be held legally responsible
OL,19,Fbecause she was suffering from
OL,20,Fpostpartum psychosis
